    {"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"1 · 核心接线：必须使用 denoised_output","pos":[930,650],"size":[760,260],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## 第一采样必须接 `denoised_output`\n\n低分辨率阶段只走 q=1→0.5 的4步。学习型模型需要第一阶段预测出的干净x0，因此这里接 SamplerCustomAdvanced 的第二个输出 `denoised_output`；不要改接第一个仍含中间噪声状态的 `output`。默认总NFE为4+4=8，并未偷加Transformer调用。"]},
    {"id":23,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"2 · 高分辨率 Conditioning 必须重新构建","pos":[1810,1270],"size":[760,270],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## 不能复用低分辨率 positive\n\n首帧、尾帧和H3 keyframe latent的空间行数由目标画布决定。第二个 Conditioning 使用同一提示词/媒体/124帧，但宽高必须和放大节点实际输出一致。本例 `preserve_source` 会把736×416约0.7MP安全对齐为1120×640。Reconcile会拒绝736×416旧条件，避免 `cond_video_rows` 尺寸错配。"]},
    {"id":24,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"3 · 模型与释放策略","pos":[2600,760],"size":[760,290],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## 学习型模型放置与卸载\n\n模型路径：`ComfyUI/models/latent_upscale_models/minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_fp16.safetensors`。节点会核验固定SHA与322张量合同，只处理24通道视频latent，音频原样保留。默认 `offload_after` 完成后只卸载该模型GPU权重；`clear_after`连CPU缓存也清理；`keep_loaded`会持续占显存，非连续批量任务不要开启。"]},
    {"id":25,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"4 · 当前边界与推荐参数","pos":[3370,650],"size":[760,300],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## 推荐起点（Advanced / EXP）\n\n低画布736×416，高画布1120×640，124帧，Turbo总8步，video/audio shift 12/3，base-flow切点0.5，`audio_policy=auto`。放大节点默认保持源宽高比并保证32整除。它是二阶段生成，不是直接锐化最终视频；不同Ref2VA/Hybrid/多关键帧/Long Video仍需单独验证，不能由本I2VA样例外推质量或16GB永不OOM。"]}
  ],
